      "message": "Close a claimed-only issue again when its report is there but it is still open\n\nData Pipeline LOW 1 on dbf084a: at selection the close ran only together with the first\nbos-claimed-v1 report, so a close that failed after the report (a transient error) was never\nretried and the issue stayed open. When the report is already there and the issue is open, the\nselection now sends the close alone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
